      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Across this pass lies the eastern edge of the Heart Mountains proper. For their distinctive shape, the orcs call these the ‘Whitefang’ Mountains, which is also the namesake of the dominant clan in this region. They are the very same who killed your father."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("The Whitefang orcs... so that’s their name. When I was younger, I remember fearing the sight of their banners rais’d across the river. Now, though, it’s something totally different. Loathing? Disgust? A desire for vengeance? Certainly... this is no longer a fight merely to protect Parthyn."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("Then it is a fight of enmity. For that, you must ensure that your hatred of these orcs is strong enough, else you will never be able to achieve your goal."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("You needn’t worry about my will to fight. I only ask that you lead me to them."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Darken Volk",
            text: _("The fastest way to the core of their dominion lies through this mountain pass. Beyond here lies your main target."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Malin Keshar",
            text: _("Then let’s go."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            x: 23,
            y: 5,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Revenge is a confession of pain."),
          },
          {
